      <h1>Social Media Management for Cardiology + Heart Specialists — India + GCC + International 2026 Playbook</h1>
      <p class="lede">How to run + hire social media management for a clinic in Cardiology + Heart Specialists? This guide covers costs, tactics, tools, timelines, compliance, and real outcomes from ITD GrowthLabs&#x27; work across 20+ clinic engagements in India + GCC. We serve cardiology practices across India + GCC with high-trust patient acquisition workflows. Serves all major India cities (Mumbai + Delhi + Bangalore + Ahmedabad + Hyderabad + Chennai + Pune + Kolkata + Gurgaon + Noida + Jaipur + Chandigarh + Thane + Navi Mumbai + Nashik + Nagpur + Lucknow + Indore + Kochi + Coimbatore), GCC (Dubai + Abu Dhabi + Sharjah + Riyadh + Jeddah + Doha + Kuwait City + Manama + Muscat), and international markets (London + Singapore + more).</p>
      <a class="book-cta" href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-doctors.php#packages">See Packages + Book Free Growth Audit &rarr;</a>
      <div class="cities">Serving India + GCC + International: Mumbai · Delhi · Bangalore · Ahmedabad · Hyderabad · Chennai · Pune · Kolkata · Gurgaon · Noida · Jaipur · Chandigarh · Lucknow · Indore + more</div>
    </section>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <div class="doc-container narrow">
        <h2>12 Answers Doctors Ask Us About Social Media Management</h2>
        <p class="lede">Analysis based on ITD GrowthLabs' work across 20+ clinic engagements in India + GCC. Client names + case study details shared on discovery call under NDA.</p>

          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>How much does social media management cost for a cardiology clinic in Mumbai?</h3>
            <div>Social media management for a cardiology clinic in Mumbai typically costs Rs 25,000 to Rs 1,50,000 per month depending on scope. Starter (single-doctor practice, 8-12 posts + 2-3 Reels): Rs 25-40K/mo. Growth (2-4 doctor clinics, 15-25 posts + 6-10 Reels + weekly ads review): Rs 60-90K/mo. Premium (multi-location or premium single-clinic, 30-50 posts + on-site video shoots): Rs 1.2-1.8L/mo. We serve cardiology practices across India + GCC with high-trust patient acquisition workflows.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>What content works best for a cardiology clinic on Instagram?</h3>
            <div>For Cardiology + Heart Specialists, the highest-engagement content mix is: (1) educational Reels on common patient concerns (cardiologist, cardiac surgeon, angioplasty, preventive cardiology, echo, ECG, ECMO) — 40% of calendar, (2) doctor + team credibility posts (qualifications, awards, publications) — 20%, (3) compliance-safe before-after or process-explainer visuals — 15%, (4) patient testimonials with consent — 10%, (5) behind-the-scenes clinic content — 10%, (6) offer + promotion posts — 5%. Reels drive 60-80% of new followers + inquiries.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>How many Instagram posts + Reels should a cardiology clinic publish per month?</h3>
            <div>For cardiology practices aiming to grow patient inquiries in Mumbai: minimum viable is 8-12 static posts + 4-6 Reels/week for solo practices; growth pace is 15-25 static + 8-12 Reels for 2-3 doctor clinics; premium multi-location clinics run 30-50 static + 15-25 Reels/month plus 3-5 in-clinic photo/video shoots quarterly. Reels drive the most patient inquiries — never under-invest here.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>Should a cardiology clinic hire an in-house team or an agency?</h3>
            <div>Depends on scale. Solo doctor + Rs 3-8L/mo revenue: agency is far more efficient (Rs 25-40K/mo covers a full pod vs Rs 50-70K for one social manager). 2-4 doctor clinics + Rs 10-40L/mo: agency still wins on creative + performance depth. Multi-location or Rs 40L+/mo: hybrid — in-house coordinator + agency for creative + performance. We serve cardiology practices across India + GCC with high-trust patient acquisition workflows.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>How does ITD handle compliance for cardiology social media content?</h3>
            <div>Every post + Reel + ad for cardiology practices runs through ASCI + MMC/MCI compliance review before publish. We avoid guaranteed-outcome language, don't offer medical advice via DM, ensure before-after posts have proper consent + disclaimer, and disclose treatment risks where relevant. Our compliance advisor reviews each week's calendar in Growth+ tiers.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>What KPIs should a cardiology clinic track on social media?</h3>
            <div>Weekly: patient inquiries via DM + link clicks + reach + Reels views + saves + shares. Monthly: cost per patient inquiry, DM to booking conversion rate, follower quality (target-city %), engagement rate on educational vs promotional content. Quarterly: revenue attribution + LTV cohorts from social-sourced patients.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>Can a cardiology clinic outsource DM + WhatsApp response management?</h3>
            <div>Yes. ITD offers DM + WhatsApp management as part of Growth+ tier. We handle: (1) 15-min response SLA business hours, (2) qualifying questions before booking, (3) WhatsApp CTWA (Click-to-WhatsApp) response, (4) inside-sales for high-AOV consultations, (5) escalation to your team for medical questions. Frees your front desk to focus on in-clinic patient experience.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>What social platforms matter for cardiology beyond Instagram?</h3>
            <div>Priority stack: (1) Instagram — 50-60% of effort (Reels + posts + DMs), (2) Facebook — 15-20% (older demographic + Facebook groups), (3) YouTube — 15-20% (long-form educational + patient testimonials for high-AOV procedures), (4) Google Business Profile posts — 10% (local SEO), (5) LinkedIn — 5% for B2B referral networks (dentists + surgeons especially).</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>How long before social media starts generating patient inquiries?</h3>
            <div>Typical timeline for cardiology practices: Month 1-2 = foundation (calendar + first Reels + first shoot); Month 3-4 = first meaningful inquiry volume (10-30/month); Month 5-6 = 30-80 inquiries/month at Growth tier with ads support; Month 12+ = compounding organic reach + 100-400 inquiries/month at scale. Organic-only takes 2-3x longer than social + ads combined.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>Do cardiology patients actually book from Instagram?</h3>
            <div>Yes — 40-60% of new patient inquiries for premium cardiology practices now originate from Instagram + WhatsApp. Patients discover via Reels, DM for consultation, get qualified via WhatsApp, book via link. High-AOV procedures (cosmetic, cardiac, IVF, hair transplant) see 60-80% of new patient discovery start on social.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>How does ITD&#x27;s social media pod work for a cardiology clinic?</h3>
            <div>Growth-tier pod: 1 social media manager (calendar + community + DMs), 1 content writer (educational + captions + scripts), 1 designer (static + carousels), 1 video editor (Reels + Shorts), 1 performance marketer (ads + attribution). Plus quarterly on-site photographer + videographer visits. Weekly sync call with your team. Monthly QBR with senior partner.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-faq-item">
            <h3>What makes ITD different from other cardiology social media agencies?</h3>
            <div>Full-stack coverage (social + Reels + on-site video + photography + ads + WhatsApp + website + branding — one team, not vendor stack), real case studies (including our flagship 5+ clinic dermatology brand + 20+ active clinics), transparent 4-tier pricing (Rs 25K-3L/mo), India + GCC + international city coverage (on-site photography for India + GCC metros), ASCI + MMC compliance workflow built in, no ad-spend markup. Book a free 30-min audit.</div>
          </div>
      </div>
